  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pan African Initiative for the Digital Transformation of TVET and Skills Development Systems in Africa is a UNESCO-led multi-partner initiative launched in March 2021 which aims support the ditgital transformation of TVET and skills systems in Africa.
The Sponsor, AfDB (AFRICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK) is Africa&apos;s premier development finance institution which was established in 1963 for the purpose of contributing to the sustainable economic development and social progress of Africa; 
AfDB wishes to sponsor the initiative in 2023/2024 and has agreed to provide financial sponsorship of 77,666 Units of Accounts which is equivalent to 104,730 USD.</narrative>
  </description>
